    "name": "Comic Store Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3557190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/57cf9d0b61d2978258d45037fe315c94.avif?t=1755103887\" width=182 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order stock, fill the shelves, hire some extra help and arrange the store however you wish. Increase your relationship with publishers to unlock new products and keep the customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/0e133e783077ad473ded76d9635dec0a.poster.avif?t=1755103887\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/0e133e783077ad473ded76d9635dec0a.webm?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/0e133e783077ad473ded76d9635dec0a.mp4?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/a1d56faef56c3e2fdd2bc4bf2243ca1f.avif?t=1755103887\" width=182 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each comic has many different cover variants to collect. With a total of over 100, start hunting those illusive rares and complete your collection. There are also out-of-print retro comics available only through auctions - happy hunting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/e343874d044768a6789d587a45e46598.poster.avif?t=1755103887\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/e343874d044768a6789d587a45e46598.webm?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/e343874d044768a6789d587a45e46598.mp4?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/8985839e8ec1eb523afff1cac5a25f4f.avif?t=1755103887\" width=182 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host meet and greet events with superheroes and autograph signings with authors. Earn bonuses during the events to increase sales for the respective publisher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/a2c34cdb5e17c997ecf293adb60e02f4.poster.avif?t=1755103887\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/a2c34cdb5e17c997ecf293adb60e02f4.webm?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/a2c34cdb5e17c997ecf293adb60e02f4.mp4?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/4d4dc13851a4ec0b6b50fb36742ac060.avif?t=1755103887\" width=182 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay to promote your favorite hero on billboards throughout the street. Running these advertisements will increase sales and interest for the duration of the promotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/82a20cabec1b821e5c09f6d4c27d885f.poster.avif?t=1755103887\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/82a20cabec1b821e5c09f6d4c27d885f.webm?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/82a20cabec1b821e5c09f6d4c27d885f.mp4?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/57cf9d0b61d2978258d45037fe315c94.avif?t=1755103887\" width=182 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order stock, fill the shelves, hire some extra help and arrange the store however you wish. Increase your relationship with publishers to unlock new products and keep the customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/0e133e783077ad473ded76d9635dec0a.poster.avif?t=1755103887\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/0e133e783077ad473ded76d9635dec0a.webm?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/0e133e783077ad473ded76d9635dec0a.mp4?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/a1d56faef56c3e2fdd2bc4bf2243ca1f.avif?t=1755103887\" width=182 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each comic has many different cover variants to collect. With a total of over 100, start hunting those illusive rares and complete your collection. There are also out-of-print retro comics available only through auctions - happy hunting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/e343874d044768a6789d587a45e46598.poster.avif?t=1755103887\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/e343874d044768a6789d587a45e46598.webm?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/e343874d044768a6789d587a45e46598.mp4?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/8985839e8ec1eb523afff1cac5a25f4f.avif?t=1755103887\" width=182 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host meet and greet events with superheroes and autograph signings with authors. Earn bonuses during the events to increase sales for the respective publisher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/a2c34cdb5e17c997ecf293adb60e02f4.poster.avif?t=1755103887\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/a2c34cdb5e17c997ecf293adb60e02f4.webm?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/a2c34cdb5e17c997ecf293adb60e02f4.mp4?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/4d4dc13851a4ec0b6b50fb36742ac060.avif?t=1755103887\" width=182 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay to promote your favorite hero on billboards throughout the street. Running these advertisements will increase sales and interest for the duration of the promotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/82a20cabec1b821e5c09f6d4c27d885f.poster.avif?t=1755103887\" width=534 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/82a20cabec1b821e5c09f6d4c27d885f.webm?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557190/extras/82a20cabec1b821e5c09f6d4c27d885f.mp4?t=1755103887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
